.agents
# The hardware image only needs these two ROS packages and its entrypoint.
# Keep the Docker context small on the RK3588; simulation, docs, Git metadata,
# generated artifacts, and all unrelated files stay outside the context.
*
!src/
!src/mower_coverage/
!src/mower_coverage/**
!src/mower_hardware/
!src/mower_hardware/**
!deploy/
!deploy/rk3588/
!deploy/rk3588/entrypoint.sh
